---
---
<aside class="stwol-author-box" aria-label="About the author">
  <style>
    .stwol-author-box {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin: 36px 0 28px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--bg2, var(--sidebar, var(--bg-soft, var(--bg-surface-elevated, #f8fafc))));
      border: 1px solid var(--border, var(--border-color, #e5e7eb));
      color: var(--text, var(--text-primary, #1f2937));
      font-family: inherit;
    }
    .stwol-author-ava {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #b45309);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .stwol-author-body {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .stwol-author-kicker {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--accent2, var(--accent-gold-dark, #b45309));
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }
    .stwol-author-name {
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 0 0 6px !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
      border: none !important;
      color: var(--text, var(--text-primary, #1f2937));
    }
    .stwol-author-bio {
      font-size: 0.9rem !important;
      line-height: 1.65 !important;
      margin: 0 0 10px !important;
      color: var(--text-soft, var(--text-secondary, var(--muted, var(--text-muted, #4b5563))));
    }
    .stwol-author-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .stwol-author-links a {
      color: var(--accent2, var(--accent-gold-dark, #b45309));
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      .stwol-author-box {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <div class="stwol-author-ava" aria-hidden="true">HS</div>
  <div class="stwol-author-body">
    <div class="stwol-author-kicker">Written &amp; Fact-Checked By</div>
    <h4 class="stwol-author-name">Harman S. — Founder &amp; Lead Engineer, Spin The Wheels Online</h4>
    <p class="stwol-author-bio">
      I built Spin The Wheels Online around the browser Web Cryptography API (<code>crypto.getRandomValues()</code>) so teachers, giveaway hosts, teams, and households can run fair, ad-light draws without accounts or hidden fees. Every example in our guides is checked against the live wheel engine and current datasets.
    </p>
    <div class="stwol-author-links">
      <a href="/about">About &amp; Editorial Standards</a>
      <a href="/changelog">Platform Changelog</a>
      <a href="/contact">Send a Correction or Suggestion</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
